Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790179199999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790121599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Most of the recent window is range, not trend: bars 51-84 (34 bars) and 88-107 (20 bars) are overlapping two-sided structures, so 54 of the last 69 bars are range bars even though the swing sequence is bullish.", "Price is at the extreme top of the window and bar 119 (high 2776.18, close 2752.43) fails to exceed bar 118's 2850 and closes below its open, a pause bar immediately after a spike bar.", "Upper tails appear on the largest bars: bar 118 closes 74.39 below its 2850 high on a 208-point range (about 36 percent of the bar) and bar 85 closes 41.64 below its 2293.80 high, showing selling into strength at the highs.", "The advance from 1916.51 (bar 85) to 2850 (+49 percent) in 34 bars has had no sustained multi-bar retracement after bar 87, a profile at least as compatible with spike/climax behaviour as with a mature channel; in this method a spike leg alone does not establish that the next leg continues."], "evidence_for": ["Swing progression since bar 31 is a clean sequence of higher highs and higher lows: 1944.39 (bar 50) to 2771 (bar 87) to 2850 (bar 118), with rising lows at 1512.91 (bar 31), 1803.74 (bar 52), 2357.18 (bar 99) and 2358.62 (bar 112).", "Two large bull bars produced accepted breakouts: bar 85 (range 388, close 2252.16) ended the 34-bar 1803.74-1974.46 range and price never closed back below 2111 (bar 86 low); bar 118 then closed 2775.61 near the window high after taking out 2771.", "Pullbacks inside the post-bar-85 advance are shallow relative to the legs (2557.46 to 2357.18 is about 8 percent), and the 20-bar consolidation at bars 88-107 held well above the prior breakout, the behaviour of a trending market rather than a two-sided range.", "Nine of the last twelve bars (108, 109, 111, 113, 114, 115, 116, 117, 118) closed above their opens, and the last five closes are all above 2397, so the most recent leg has directional follow-through."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, first open_time 1779753600000 (open 2109.85) to last open_time 1790035200000 (close 2752.43); window high 2850 at bar 118, window low 1368.42 at bar 11.", "Bars 0-11 fall from high 2138.82 (bar 0) to low 1368.42 (bar 11); bar 11 (open 1581.32) closes 1568.55, leaving a ~200-point lower tail, and bar 12 immediately reverses to close 1687.83.", "Bars 12-36 are two-sided and heavily overlapping between low 1512.91 (bar 31) and high 1845.09 (bar 20); bars 22-36 form a narrower lower band with three tests of 1551.60-1560.05.", "Bars 37-50 close progressively higher; bar 49 (open 1775.60) closes 1889.93 and bar 50 prints high 1944.39.", "Bars 51-84 rotate in a 34-bar range between 1803.74 (bar 52 low) and 1974.46 (bar 62 high); bars 74-84 tighten to roughly 1868-1919 on small-range bars.", "Bar 85 (open 1916.51) closes 2252.16 at high 2293.80 with a 388-point range, breaking out of that 34-bar range; bars 86-87 extend the leg to 2771.", "Bars 88-107 hold above the breakout in a 20-bar range between 2357.18 (bar 99 low) and 2557.46 (bar 93 high).", "Bar 108 (open 2437) closes 2514.72 at high 2680; bars 110-114 pull back to 2358.62 (bar 112 closes 2397.10).", "Bars 115-118 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, taking out 2771 to a new window high 2850; bar 119 (open 2775.60, high 2776.18, low 2716.01, close 2752.43) is a small bear bar that fails to exceed bar 118's high."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear swing, bars 0-11: eleven lower closes from 2072.79 to 1568.55; 12 bars carry price from the 2138.82 window high down to 1368.42, and bar 11's long lower tail with a close back at 1568.55 marks climactic rejection of that low rather than a clean close at the extreme.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779753600000, "upper_boundary": "2138.82"}, {"description": "Post-selloff trading range, bars 12-36: two-sided, overlapping bars between 1512.91 (bar 31 low) and 1845.09 (bar 20 high); the second half (bars 22-36) sits in a lower band near 1551-1740 with three separate low tests around 1551.60-1560.05.", "end_time_ms": 1782950399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Bull leg, bars 37-50: higher closes from bar 37's 1597.72 low to bar 50's 1944.39 high, including a large bull bar at 49 (open 1775.60, close 1889.93) and a 1804.49-1828.20 high zone at bars 40-41. This leg lifts price out of the 1512.91-1845.09 base.", "end_time_ms": 1784073599999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1597.72", "start_time_ms": 1782950400000, "upper_boundary": "1944.39"}, {"description": "Large trading range, bars 51-84: 34 bars rotating between 1803.74 (bar 52 low) and 1974.46 (bar 62 high), with 1954-1959 highs at bars 57 and 61; bars 74-84 compress into a tight ~1868-1919 zone on small bodies before the breakout.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1803.74", "start_time_ms": 1784073600000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike, bars 85-87: bar 85 breaks the 34-bar range with a 388-point bar (open 1916.51, high 2293.80, close 2252.16), and bars 86-87 continue to 2771, an ~850-point advance in three bars.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Bull-flag range, bars 88-107: 20 overlapping bars between 2357.18 (bar 99 low) and 2557.46 (bar 93 high), all holding far above the bar-85 breakout low; bar 112 later dips back to 2358.62 inside this general zone.", "end_time_ms": 1788998399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Second bull breakout, bars 108-119: bar 108 (open 2437) closes 2514.72 at high 2680, a five-bar pullback reaches 2358.62 (bar 112), then bars 115-118 run to a new window high 2850 (bar 118, close 2775.61) before bar 119 stalls with a 2776.18 high.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789084800000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a daily close above 2850 (bar 118 high) with the close in the upper half of the bar and no close below 2716.01 (bar 119 low) keeps the breakout-spike read and extends the higher-high sequence.", "Shift to range: several consecutive closes back inside 2357.18-2557.46 (the bar 88-107 band) without a new high would make the post-bar-85 structure a trading range and move phase toward 'range'.", "Trend-doubt: a close below 2436.87 (bar 115 low) or 2435.72 (bar 108 low) would break the higher low that the latest leg tested and push primary_regime toward transition-unclear.", "Larger reversal evidence: a close below 2358.62 (bar 112 low) followed by a lower swing high would break the last higher low of the bull sequence and make a retracement toward 2111 (bar 86 low) the dominant structural read.", "Acceleration or exhaustion: another bull bar with a range above 250 closing at a new high confirms the spike phase, while a bear reversal bar closing below 2716.01 after a new high would raise the mtr-like top alternative to the current read."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790164799999, "directional_pressure": "bear", "evidence_against": ["Bar 108 closed at 2723.15, in the lower half of its 2658.06-2850 range, which is a weak close for a bull spike and could mark a buy climax/exhaustion.", "After bar 108, price has made lower highs at 2804.59 (bar 111) and 2786.81 (bar 119) and is now testing the range low, a pattern that could be an early MTR-like topping structure if 2716.01 breaks.", "The recent 12 bars are overlapping and two-sided, so always-in relevance is low and the bull-trend read is not currently supported by trend-bar follow-through.", "A close below 2716.01 would likely flip the short-term always-in to short and could shift the phase from range toward transition or bear-trend if 2568.16 also breaks.", "The last two bars are bear bars closing near the low, showing immediate downside pressure that could continue even if the higher-level trend is still up."], "evidence_for": ["Higher low at 2358.62 (bar 74 low) followed by a higher high at 2850 (bar 108 high), with the intermediate high at 2643.52 (bar 92 high) exceeding the prior range highs at 2519.81 (bar 90 high) and 2609.02 (bar 69 high).", "Strong bull spike bars at bar 91 (close 2578.60) and bar 108 (high 2850) show bullish breakout momentum within the window.", "The recent 12 bars overlap between 2716.01 and 2804.59, so the current phase is a two-sided range rather than a confirmed bear reversal.", "No close below the 2716.01 range low or the 2568.16 major swing low has occurred, so the higher-low sequence and the bull-trend classification remain intact.", "The last two bear bars (119-120) are small relative to bar 108's bull spike and have not produced a strong bear breakout.", "The last strong breakout signal in the window was the bull spike at bar 108, so the always-in direction remains long."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Bar 120 (open 2741.96, high 2748.23, low 2717.02, close 2726.81) is a bear bar closing near its low and testing the recent range low at 2716.01 (bar 113 low).", "Bars 119-120 form a two-bar bear leg from 2786.81 (bar 119 high) to 2717.02 (bar 120 low), reversing down after bar 118 closed bullishly at 2772.99.", "The recent 12 closed bars (109-120) overlap and oscillate between 2716.01 (bar 113 low) and 2804.59 (bar 111 high), with no closes outside this range.", "Bar 108 is the window's highest high at 2850, a large bull spike (open 2658.81, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) that closed in the lower half of its range, leaving a long upper tail.", "The broader window shows a higher low at 2358.62 (bar 74 low), a higher high at 2643.52 (bar 92 high), a higher low at 2568.16 (bar 102 low), and a higher high at 2850 (bar 108 high).", "Bar 91 broke above the 74-90 range high at 2519.81 (bar 90 high) and closed at 2578.60, with follow-through to a 2643.52 high at bar 92.", "Within the recent range, bar 111 high 2804.59 and bar 119 high 2786.81 are lower highs relative to the 2850 spike high, while bar 113 low 2716.01 and bar 120 low 2717.02 are the lowest recent levels.", "The last two bars have lower highs and lower lows, but the window's higher-low sequence above 2568.16 remains unbroken."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bull trend from the 2358.62 low (bar 74) to the 2850 high (bar 108), with higher highs and higher lows; includes the bar 91-92 breakout and the bar 108 spike.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Two-sided range after the 2850 high, with overlapping bars oscillating between 2716.01 (bar 113 low) and 2804.59 (bar 111 high); the last two bars (119-120) are a bear leg testing the lower boundary.", "end_time_ms": 1790164799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2716.01", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Large bull spike bar (bar 108) with high 2850 and close 2723.15, closing in the lower half of its 2658.06-2850 range; potential buy climax or exhaustion bar.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Bull breakout above the 74-90 range high at 2519.81 (bar 90 high); bar 91 closed at 2578.60 and bar 92 followed through to a 2643.52 high.", "end_time_ms": 1789761599999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2519.81", "start_time_ms": 1789732800000, "upper_boundary": "2643.52"}, {"description": "Two-bar bear leg from 2786.81 (bar 119 high) to 2717.02 (bar 120 low), closing near the low and testing the recent range low at 2716.01.", "end_time_ms": 1790164799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2717.02", "start_time_ms": 1790136000000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close below 2716.01 (bar 113 low) on a bear bar with follow-through would confirm a downside breakout from the recent range and weaken the bull-trend/pullback read.", "A close below 2568.16 (bar 102 low) would break the major higher low and strengthen a bear-trend or confirmed MTR interpretation.", "A bull reversal bar closing back above 2748.23 (bar 120 high) or 2786.81 (bar 119 high) would suggest the range low held and keep the bull-trend/pullback read intact.", "A close above 2804.59 (bar 111 high) would signal a bull breakout from the recent range and resume the bull trend.", "A strong bear bar closing below 2658.06 (bar 108 low) would break the bull spike low and likely flip always-in to short."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2596.45", "close_time_ms": 1789750799999, "high": "2605.57", "low": "2578.44", "open": "2579.97", "open_time_ms": 1789747200000, "volume": "2231312.238"}, {"close": "2605.5", "close_time_ms": 1789754399999, "high": "2606.24", "low": "2585.2", "open": "2596.45", "open_time_ms": 1789750800000, "volume": "2348369.001"}, {"close": "2611.28", "close_time_ms": 1789757999999, "high": "2619.57", "low": "2601.86", "open": "2